"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"503a896ebba6bad4\" href=\"?note=503a896ebba6bad4\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-transitive-relation.md\">../batch11/58-df-transitive-relation.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PotentialistFrame}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PotentialistFrame}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}potentialist\\text{-}frame} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PotentialistFrame}_S(\\mathcal W,R,\\Gamma,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\mathcal W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\nR\\subseteq\\mathcal W\\times\\mathcal W\\land\n\\mathrm{Reflexive}(R,\\mathcal W)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(R,\\mathcal W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}potentialist\\text{-}frame} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PotentialistFrame}_S(\\mathcal W,R,\\Gamma,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\mathcal W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\nR\\subseteq\\mathcal W\\times\\mathcal W\\land\n\\mathrm{Reflexive}(R,\\mathcal W)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(R,\\mathcal W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-lab